Yeah but it's a lot more than that.  Here's what I wrote in yesterday's comments:

@Flyboy54 noted this earlier and now that I check, it's remarkable.  They are very similar puzzles.   Here's Johnny and the actual, identical revealer are both in the same place.  Both quote the same 3 movies (Shining, Frankenstein, and Saw) with identical or near identical wording.

